{"product_id":"photoshop-7-in-easy-steps","title":"Photoshop 7 in Easy Steps","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe power and sophistication of Photoshop 7 comes at a price - a steep learning curve. \"Photoshop 7 in Easy Steps\" recognizes this fact and is specifically designed to take you step by step in a logical, structured sequence to a detailed understanding of the software. It uses concise explanations and copious screen shots to simply and effectively create a clear, logical path to understanding and mastering the software. The book guides you from the basic color therapy to layers, paths and the pen tool, channels and masks as well as colour correction techniques.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Robert Shufflebotham\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781840782189\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 240\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 187 x 226\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42595760636057,"sku":"4RB9781840782189","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/photoshop-7-in-easy-steps-513696.jpg?v=1694791265","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/photoshop-7-in-easy-steps","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}